OL,3,GNEWSACommunities fall silent to mark
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe south east of England fell silent
OL,7,Fon Remembrance Sunday to honour those
OL,8,Fwho lost their lives in conflict.
OL,10,FCrowds gathered at war memorials across
OL,11,FKent, Sussex and Surrey as wreaths were
OL,12,Flaid in tribute to the fallen as
OL,13,Fcommunities across the three counties
OL,14,Fcame together, falling silent at 11:00
OL,15,FGMT to remember the fallen.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
