OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACommunities fall silent to mark
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Netherfield, East Sussex, people
OL,7,Fmade poppies from old plastic bottles
OL,8,Fwere put up to remember lost loved ones
OL,9,Fand in Rusthall, near Tunbridge Well in
OL,10,FKent, poppies were dropped from the
OL,11,Fbell tower onto the choir at St Paul's
OL,12,Fchurch.
OL,14,FGeorge Durrant, 102, who served in
OL,15,FBurma during World War Two was in the
OL,16,Fparade at Crawley, in West Sussex.
